  "data-value=\"outside\" title=\"Outside micrometer — measures across a part between anvil and spindle. The sleeve is numbered from the frame outwards.\">Outside</button>": "data-value=\"outside\" title=\"外径千分尺 —— 在测砧与测微螺杆之间测量工件外形。套筒自尺架向外标注。\">外径</button>",
  "data-value=\"depth\" title=\"Depth micrometer — measures into a hole, slot or step from a reference plane. The sleeve is numbered BACKWARDS and the reading is the first number hidden by the thimble.\">Depth</button>": "data-value=\"depth\" title=\"深度千分尺 —— 从基准面测量孔深、槽深或台阶。套筒反向标注，读数是微分筒盖住的第一个数字。\">深度</button>",
